            "value": "An <em>N</em>-glycosyl-1,3,5-triazine that is 4-amino-1,3,5-triazin-2(1<em>H</em>)-one substituted by a β-<small>D</small>-ribofuranosyl residue via an <em>N</em>-glycosidic linkage. An antineoplastic agent, it is used in the treatment of myeloid leukaemia."
