            "predicate": "IAO:0000115",
            "stanza": "CHEBI:2766",
            "subject": "CHEBI:2766",
            "value": "A tetracyclic diterpenoid that has an tetradecahydro-8,11a-methanocyclohepta[<em>a</em>]naphthalene skeleton with two hydroxymethyl substituents at positions 4 and 9, two methyl substituents at positions 4 and 11b and two hydroxy substituents at positions 3 and 9. An antibiotic with antiviral and antimitotical properties. Aphidicolin is a reversible inhibitor of eukaryotic nuclear DNA replication."
          },
