            "predicate": "IAO:0000115",
            "stanza": "CHEBI:156452",
            "subject": "CHEBI:156452",
            "value": "A dithiolopyrrolone antibiotic that is 4,5-dihydro[1,2]dithiolo[4,3-<em>b</em>]pyrrole in which the hydrogens at positions 4,5 and 6 have been replaced by methyl, oxo and propanoylamino groups, respectively. It is a moderate antimicrobial by-product of the thiolutin fermentation in various <em>Streptomyces</em> species."
