            "predicate": "IAO:0000115",
            "stanza": "CHEBI:31264",
            "subject": "CHEBI:31264",
            "value": "A (synthetic) quaternary ammonium salt that is benzyldimethylamine in which the nitrogen is quaternised by a 2-{2-[<em>p</em>-(2,4,4-trimethylpentan-2-yl)phenoxy]ethoxy}ethyl group, with chloride as the counter-ion. An antiseptic and disinfectant, it is active against a broad spectrum of bacteria, fungi, moulds and viruses."
