            "stanza": "CHEBI:65585",
            "subject": "CHEBI:65585",
            "value": "An abietane diterpenoid that is abieta-8,11,13-triene substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 11 and 12 and a carboxy group at position 20. It is isolated from rosemary (<em>Rosmarinus officinalis</em>) and common sage (<em>Salvia officinalis</em>) and exhibits anti-angiogenic, antineoplastic, antioxidant and anti-HIV activity."
