            "predicate": "IAO:0000115",
            "stanza": "CHEBI:27729",
            "subject": "CHEBI:27729",
            "value": "A spirostanyl glycoside that is digitogenin in which the 3-hydroxy group is substituted by a β-<small>D</small>-glucopyranosyl-(1→3)-β-<small>D</small>-galactopyranosyl-(1→2)-[β-<small>D</small>-xylopyranosyl-(1→3)]-β-<small>D</small>-glucopyranosyl-(1→4)-β-<small>D</small>-galactopyranosyl group. It is a steroidal saponin isolated from the foxglove plant, <em>Digitalis purpurea</em>. It is used extensively as a mild non-ionic detergent for extracting proteins from membranes for structure and function studies."
