            "stanza": "CHEBI:4878",
            "subject": "CHEBI:4878",
            "value": "The dihydrchloride salt of ethambutol. A bacteriostatic antimycobacterial drug, it is effective against <em>Mycobacterium tuberculosis</em> and some other mycobacteria. It is used in combination with other antituberculous drugs in the treatment of pulmonary and extrapulmonary tuberculosis; resistant strains of <em>M. tuberculosis</em> are readily produced if ethambutol dihydrochloride is used alone."
