      "reason": "Preserve the complete original negative decision; current target/alias/source changes do not resolve its full scientific scope. Current named assertion MIM:0001238 (Green House Soil) skos:broadMatch ENVO:00001998 (soil) was assessed against its actual owner and captured ENVO declaration. The retained specific supplied form is linked to a broader parent without identity collapse or an is-a inference. The actual published alias field is ''; rejected labels and competing-owner tokens remain suppressed, not silently approved.  Every source/comment token is assessed as attributed history, not new evidence acquisition. Latest-event mapping_date and deterministic confidence do not grant science; removed validation stamps are preserved in beforeimages. No role, occurrence, source-binding, quantity, component, owner-merge, subclass or release approval follows.",
