      "entry_id": "row-002145",
      "judgment": "INSTALL_WITHHOLD",
      "reason": "Preserve the complete original negative decision; current target/alias/source changes do not resolve its full scientific scope. Current named assertion MIM:0001909 (N,N,N′,N′-Tetrakis(2-pyridylmethyl)ethylenediamine) skos:exactMatch CHEBI:88217 (N,N,N',N'-tetrakis(2-pyridylmethyl)ethylenediamine) was assessed against its actual owner and captured CHEBI declaration. The own-identifier or exact named-concept relation retains its substance/class boundary, salt, hydration and stereochemical qualifications. The actual published alias field is 'N(1),N(1),N(2),N(2)-tetrakis[(pyridin-2-yl)methyl]ethane-1,2-diamine|CAS:16858-02-9'; rejected labels and competing-owner tokens remain suppressed, not silently approved.  Every source/comment token is assessed as attributed history, not new evidence acquisition. Latest-event mapping_date and deterministic confidence do not grant science; removed validation stamps are preserved in beforeimages. No role, occurrence, source-binding, quantity, component, owner-merge, subclass or release approval follows.",
