            "stanza": "CHEBI:73468",
            "subject": "CHEBI:73468",
            "value": "The <i>meso</i>-form of nordihydroguaiaretic acid. An antioxidant found in the creosote bush, <em>Larrea divaricata</em>, it is a potent lipoxygenase inhibitor that interferes with arachidonic acid metabolism. It also inhibits (though to a lesser extent) formyltetrahydrofolate synthetase, carboxylesterase, and cyclooxygenase."
