            "stanza": "CHEBI:166872",
            "subject": "CHEBI:166872",
            "value": "A nucleoside antibiotic that is 5'-<em>O</em>-sulfamoyladenosine in which the hydrogen atom at position 4' is replaced by a fluorine atom. It is a natural product synthesized by several <em>Streptomyces</em> species. It exhibits broad spectrum antibacterial activity, and also has a strong effect against <em>Trypanosoma brucei</em>, the protozoan parasite responsible for the African sleeping sickness."
