      "judgment": "INSTALL_WITHHOLD",
      "reason": "Preserve the complete original negative decision; current target/alias/source changes do not resolve its full scientific scope. Current named assertion MIM:0001929 (Nutrient broth No. 2) skos:exactMatch MICRO:0000082 (nutrient broth) was assessed against its actual owner and captured MICRO declaration. The own-identifier or exact named-concept relation retains its substance/class boundary, salt, hydration and stereochemical qualifications. The actual published alias field is 'Nutrient Broth (OXOID)|Nutrient Broth (BD cat 234000)|Nutrient Broth (Difco)|Nutrient broth (BD Difco)|Nutrient broth (BD-Difco)|Nutrient broth (NB) (Difco)'; rejected labels and competing-owner tokens remain suppressed, not silently approved.  Every source/comment token is assessed as attributed history, not new evidence acquisition. Latest-event mapping_date and deterministic confidence do not grant science; removed validation stamps are preserved in beforeimages. No role, occurrence, source-binding, quantity, component, owner-merge, subclass or release approval follows.",
