            "stanza": "CHEBI:16709",
            "subject": "CHEBI:16709",
            "value": "A hydroxymethylpyridine with hydroxymethyl groups at positions 4 and 5, a hydroxy group at position 3 and a methyl group at position 2. The 4-methanol form of vitamin B<small><sub>6</sub></small>, it is converted intoto pyridoxal phosphate which is a coenzyme for synthesis of amino acids, neurotransmitters, sphingolipids and aminolevulinic acid."
          },
